          "text": "If we consider each Atlas-950 SuperPoD 64-card cabinet uses peak 100kW power, then just the 111k cabinets alone would use 11.1GW of power.  Add in remaining 45% of AI chips that are not part of SuperNode, I think China will be building at least 20GW of Data center per yr.",
