          "text": "20GW of AIDC construction/yr would match other figures I've seen which estimated 75-80GW over next 4 yrs.  This also implies other part of supply chain like memory can keep up w/ this much production. It seems like 2026-2027 will have plenty of scaling across the supply chain.",
